{"run_id": "run_fe425c04781a", "dialogue_id": "fm_ask_quota_rule_002", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "s03_ask_contract", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "嗯是我。飞毛腿名额是怎么分配的？新人会不会被刷掉？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "这个问题我来解释一下。飞毛腿名额是按排名分配的，配送完成率越高、拒单越少、取消和超时越少，排名就越靠前。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "那新人是不是没机会？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "不会的，新人也有机会。只要按时完成配送，减少拒单和超时，排名会慢慢上去。飞毛腿合同今天生效，需要按要求完成配送量，否则合同和派单可能受影响。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "明白了，那我就正常跑好了。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，午晚高峰记得上线配送，有问题随时联系。再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 3, "tool_name": "answer_policy_question", "arguments": {"topic": "quota_rule", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task"}, "result": {"status": "ok"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "explained", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
